{
  "version": 2,
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": [
        "# Hello, Compiler Notebook\n",
        "\n",
        "A **buildspec cell** (the `toml` cell below) opens a project and configures it.\n",
        "Every source cell under it belongs to that project, until the next buildspec\n",
        "cell. Running any cell of a project builds the whole project, and the output\n",
        "lands on the buildspec cell."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "toml",
      "value": [
        "compiler = \"g++\"\n",
        "flags    = [\"-std=c++20\", \"-O2\", \"-Wall\", \"-Wextra\"]\n",
        "mode     = \"run\"\n",
        "output   = \"hello\"\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": [
        "#pragma once\n",
        "\n",
        "#include <string>\n",
        "\n",
        "inline std::string greeting() {\n",
        "    return \"hello from a compiler notebook v0.0.1\";\n",
        "}\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "greeting.hpp"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": [
        "Prose in the middle of a project is fine — Markdown cells never end a project."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": [
        "#include <iostream>\n",
        "\n",
        "#include \"greeting.hpp\"\n",
        "\n",
        "int main() {\n",
        "    std::cout << greeting() << '\\n';\n",
        "    return 0;\n",
        "}\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "main.cpp"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": [
        "## A second, independent project\n",
        "\n",
        "The buildspec cell below starts a new project. It builds in its own temp dir\n",
        "with its own flags, and its `main.cpp` does not collide with the one above."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "toml",
      "value": [
        "# Every key is optional: compiler and flags default from the cell language.\n",
        "mode = \"build\"\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": [
        "#include <vector>\n",
        "#include <numeric>\n",
        "\n",
        "int main() {\n",
        "    std::vector<int> v(10);\n",
        "    std::iota(v.begin(), v.end(), 1);\n",
        "    return std::accumulate(v.begin(), v.end(), 0) == 55 ? 0 : 1;\n",
        "}\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "main.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
